# Opt-in ERA5 temporal interpolation with licensed BADA 4 TEM.
# Run with: IC research/era5-tem-interpolation
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === ERA5 TEMPORAL INTERPOLATION GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO Interpolation is explicitly enabled before loading the 12:00 and 13:00 files.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT Provenance records both slots and the UTC-derived blend fraction.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST EXPECT Matched level-flight REPORT and OFF propagation remains identical with no events.
00:00:00.20>DATE 15,8,2025,12:30:00
00:00:00.25>PLUGIN LOAD WINDECMWF
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.35>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:00.42>METEOCONFIG STRICT ON
00:00:00.44>METEOCONFIG TIMEUPDATE ON
00:00:00.46>METEOCONFIG INTERPOLATION ON
00:00:00.50>WINDECMWF 40,-5,45,5
00:00:00.55>METEOSTATUS 41.3,2.1,FL100
00:00:01.00>CRE EITR,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.00>CRE EITO,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS EITR TEM
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS EITO TEM
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG EITR PYBADA
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG EITO PYBADA
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPECHECKS EITR LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPECHECKS EITO LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE EITR REPORT
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE EITO OFF
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START era5-tem-interpolation.csv
00:00:15.00>ATMOSSTATUS EITR
00:00:15.00>ATMOSSTATUS EITO
00:00:20.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:20.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_era5_interpolation_run.py on output/era5-tem-interpolation.csv.
00:00:21.00>HOLD
